    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Collaboration Between Two Indie Fighting Games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-art robots and disassembled-body aliens<br>finally face off in an epic battle for supremacy!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803620/extras/706c3d96f359644f6252b900d105ac66.avif?t=1750626097\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>simple 2-button controls</strong>,<br>anyone can jump in and enjoy the thrills of tag-team fighting action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803620/extras/928fa3f4cc95381e2fc72665f77830dd.avif?t=1750626097\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is developed using the 8-bit fantasy console <strong>PICO-8</strong>.<br>Experience the dynamic animations that push the limits of this tiny engine!</p>",
